1920 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Library of Congress \174 Enterprise System Modernization \174 Mar 2025 \055 July 2026\n\nLed product discovery and UX research for the modernization of the Enterprise Copyright System\054 partnering with technical leadership and subject matter experts to redesign complex workflows across copyright registration and financial operations\056\nTranslated legacy business processes into intuitive user experiences through user interviews\054 journey mapping\054 user flows\054 wireframes\054 and interactive prototypes\056\nBuilt and expanded the Enterprise Copyright System design system by creating new reusable components\054 design tokens\054 and documentation that established scalable UI standards across the platform\056\nDesigned enterprise administration tools supporting role\055based permissions\054 user management\054 and platform governance across a system processing more than 100\054000 users and application submissions\056\nPartnered with accounting stakeholders to conduct discovery and define the user experience for a new financial management workspace within the Enterprise Copyright System\056\nWrote user stories and implementation\055ready design specifications while partnering closely with engineering and QA to ensure successful product delivery\056\nDesigned accessible\054 form\055heavy enterprise workflows aligned with WCAG 2\0561 AA and Section 508\054 proactively identifying barriers related to content hierarchy\054 form labels\054 instructions\054 error recovery\054 keyboard flow\054 focus states\054 and color contrast\073 validated implementation with WAVE and manual accessibility reviews\056)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 1921 0 R
     /Pg 1898 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

