1922 0 obj
  << /ActualText (U\056S\056 House of Representatives \174 Enterprise Voting Modernization \174 Mar 2024 \055 Mar 2025\n\nLed the end\055to\055end design of a new enterprise voting platform for all of Congress\054 transforming complex legislative processes into an intuitive digital experience\056\nPartnered directly with House leadership and subject matter experts through recurring discovery sessions to define requirements\054 user flows\054 and product strategy\056\nBuilt a scalable\054 accessible design system using USWDS\054 including 30\053 reusable components with documented behavior for keyboard interaction\054 focus management\054 form validation\054 responsive use\054 and component states\054 supported by design tokens and implementation\055ready specifications\056\nDeveloped interactive prototypes that accelerated stakeholder alignment and reduced ambiguity before engineering implementation\056\nWrote user stories and acceptance criteria to support Agile delivery and create a shared understanding between design\054 product\054 and engineering\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1923 0 R
     /Pg 1898 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

