1926 0 obj
  << /ActualText (USDA National Agricultural Statistics Service \050NASS\051 \174 Enterprise System Modernization\n\nLed the modernization of enterprise applications supporting agricultural data collection for more than 10\054000 farmers nationwide\nDesigned and implemented a scalable enterprise design system using Figma\054 Blazor\054 HTML\054 CSS\054 SCSS\054 and the U\056S\056 Web Design System \050USWDS\051\054 establishing reusable components and standardized UI patterns across multiple applications\056\nPartnered with product owners\054 engineers\054 and stakeholders to translate business requirements into intuitive user flows\054 prototypes\054 and implementation\055ready designs\056\nEstablished repeatable accessibility standards across multiple federal enterprise products\054 applying WCAG 2\0561 AA and Section 508 criteria during design reviews and component development\073 combined expert manual evaluation with WAVE and Accessibility Insights to identify and resolve barriers before engineering handoff\056\nContributed to the modernization of legacy government applications by creating scalable templates that accelerated development and improved consistency across the product ecosystem\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 1927 0 R
     /Pg 1898 0 R
     /S /Span
