  << /ActualText (Athletico \174 Patient Onboarding \046 Appointment Scheduling Platform\n\nDesigned accessible patient onboarding and appointment\055scheduling experiences aligned with WCAG 2\0561 AA and applicable ADA requirements across desktop\054 tablet\054 and mobile\054 proactively addressing keyboard navigation\054 focus states\054 form labels\054 validation\054 error recovery\054 color contrast\054 and responsive reflow\056\nPartnered with product managers\054 engineers\054 and fellow designers to create intuitive user flows\054 wireframes\054 prototypes\054 and production\055ready interfaces aligned with the organization\047s design system\056\nFacilitated user testing with more than 100 participants\054 incorporating research findings into iterative product improvements\056\nContributed to an estimated 8\045 increase in patient acquisition through improvements to the patient registration and scheduling experience\056)
